Controller tests
------------------------------
hasUsersDelegatesToUsers - hasUsers passes straight through to users.hasUser, true and false
verifyLoginDelegatesToUsers - verifyLogin passes through and is verified against the mock
needsPasswordSetupDelegatesToUsers - needsPasswordSetup passes through and is verified against the mock
isAdminDelegatesToAccess - isAdmin passes through to access.isAdmin
createFirstAccountSucceeds - first account creates the user, sets the password, returns "Account is created!"
createFirstAccountReturnsExceptionMessage - createUser throwing returns the exception message
changePasswordSucceeds - changePassword delegates and returns "Password changed"
changePasswordReturnsExceptionMessage - changePassword throwing returns the exception message
createUserSucceedsForAdmin - admin creating a user returns "" and calls users.createUser
createUserRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin gets "Not allowed" and users is never touched
createUserReturnsExceptionMessage - createUser throwing returns the exception message
manageAccessPromotesUser - admin promote returns "alice was promoted"
manageAccessDemotesUser - admin demote returns "alice was demoted"
manageAccessFalseResultIsNotAllowed - promote returning false gives "Not allowed"
manageAccessRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin manageAccess returns "Not allowed"
manageAccessRejectsBadAction - unknown action returns "Invalid option"
listUsernamesExcludesCaller - admin list excludes the caller, others joined with newlines
listUsernamesRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin list returns "Not allowed" and users is never touched
showMainMenuShowsAdminOptions - admin menu shows all 11 options
showMainMenuHidesAdminOptions - standard menu shows 1-5, 9 and 11 only
browseMainMenuShowsAdminOptions - admin browse menu shows List, Read, Add, Edit, Back
browseMainMenuHidesAdminOptions - standard browse menu shows List, Read, Back only
browseMainMenuRejectsBadType - unknown type returns "Invalid option"
listEntriesListsBriefs - briefs list as "id : title" lines
listEntriesListsAgents - agents list as "id : name" lines
listEntriesListsFacilities - facilities list as "id : name" lines
listEntriesListsMissions - missions list as "id : title" lines
listEntriesRejectsBadType - unknown type returns "Invalid option"
readEntryPrintsBriefAndAudits - brief read prints Title/Date/Content and logs a READ audit for "briefs 1"
readEntryPrintsAgent - agent read prints Name/DoB/DoDeath/Notes
readEntryPrintsFacility - facility read prints Name/Abbreviation
readEntryPrintsMission - mission read prints Title/Facility ID
readEntryHandlesUnknownId - unknown brief id returns "No brief found with this id"
readEntryRejectsBadType - unknown type returns "Invalid option"
addEntryAddsBriefAuditsAndRelists - admin brief add audits CREATE "briefs 7" and relists
addEntryAddsAgentWithoutMission - admin agent add passes null missionID and relists
addEntryAddsMission - admin mission add captures title and facilityID and relists
addEntryRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin add returns "Not allowed" and store is never touched
addEntryRejectsBadType - unknown type returns "Invalid option"
addEntryReturnsBadNumberMessage - non-numeric missionID returns the parse message
addEntryReturnsStoreMessage - store throwing returns its message
editEntryEditsBriefAndRelists - brief edit updates id/missionID/title and relists
editEntryKeepsAgentMission - agent edit keeps the existing missionID (5) while facility changes
editEntryRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin edit returns "Not allowed" and store is never touched
editEntryHandlesUnknownId - unknown brief id returns "No brief found with this id"
editEntryRejectsBadType - unknown type returns "Invalid option"
editEntryReturnsStoreMessage - store throwing on update returns its message
reviewAuditLogFormatsEntries - audit log formats as "time : user : read/create : record" lines
reviewAuditLogRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin audit review returns "Not allowed"
reviewAuditLogEmptyIsEmpty - empty log returns ""
assignAgentToMissionSucceeds - admin assign returns "Agent 1 assigned to mission 2"
assignAgentToMissionRefusesNonAdmin - non-admin assign returns "Not allowed"
assignAgentToMissionReturnsStoreMessage - store throwing returns "Not implemented yet"
sendMessageFindsAgentCaseInsensitively - "ghost" finds Ghost and returns "Message sent to Ghost"
sendMessageHandlesUnknownAgent - unknown agent returns "No agent found with this name"
viewMessagesShowsOwnMessages - "ghost" sees own messages joined with newlines
viewMessagesWithoutAgentIsEmpty - no matching agent returns "No messages"
viewMessagesEmptyListIsEmpty - empty message list returns "No messages"
Notes: collaborators are Mockito mocks; every method is
tested on its real returned text, reusing the HW5
UserInterface wording and inputs. No listUsernames tests:
the 18-method interface has no listUsernames.
Run: .\gradlew test --tests "control.ControllerTest" --console=plain
